[{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":9,"col":13},"end":{"line":9,"col":32}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`bike.trail ++ other` adds to the end of `bike.trail` itself, but `bike.trail`\nis read again afterwards.\n\n 9|    walls = bike.trail ++ other\n               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n10|    ( bike, List.length walls )\n         ^^^^ and `bike.trail` is read here, after the change\n\nIf the list were changed in place, `bike.trail` would see the change when it is\nread on line 10.\n\nTo change a copy and leave `bike.trail` as it was, copy it there:\n\n9|    walls = List.copy bike.trail ++ other\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: `bike.trail` is read on line 10, after the\nchange."},{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":18,"col":18},"end":{"line":18,"col":51}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`Main.shoot` changes `model.red.trail` in place, but `model.red.trail` is read\nagain afterwards.\n\n18|    ( red, _ ) = shoot model.red model.green.trail\n                    ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n19|    ( green, _ ) = shoot model.green model.red.trail\n                                        ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ and `model.red.trail` is read here, after the change\n\nIf the list were changed in place, `model.red.trail` would see the change when\nit is read on line 19.\n\nCopy the list with `List.copy` before it is changed, so the change cannot reach\nanything else that holds it.\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: `model.red.trail` is read on line 19, after\nthe change."}]
